*Script bang !AutoRun
*Script exec !VarSet TaskCount 0
*Script exec wscript $ThemeDir$lister.vbs "$QuickLaunchPath$"
*Script exec !If ["%{FirstRun}" = "1"] [!FirstRun]
*Script ~bang

*Script bang !FirstRun
*Script exec !VarSet FirstRun 0
*Script exec !VarSave FirstRun
*Script exec !Recycle
*Script ~bang

*Script bang !OrbCenter
*Script exec !VarSet OrbX %#%{MouseX}-OrbWidth/2%#
*Script exec !VarSave OrbX
*Script exec !VarSet OrbY %#%{MouseY}-OrbHeight/2%#
*Script exec !VarSave OrbY
*Script exec !nMove Orb %{OrbX} %{OrbY} 100 sine
*Script exec !nMove nTasks %#%{OrbX}+OrbWidth+nTasksColumnSpacing%# %#%{OrbY}+OrbHeight/2-nTasksHeight/2%# 100 sine
*Script ~bang

*Script bang !TasksAdd
*Script exec !VarAdd TasksCount 1
*Script exec !nSize nTasks %#(UIButtonSize+nTasksColumnSpacing)*%{TasksCount}%# %#nTasksHeight%#
*Script ~bang

*Script bang !TasksDel
*Script exec !VarAdd TasksCount -1
*Script exec !nSize nTasks %#(UIButtonSize+nTasksColumnSpacing)*%{TasksCount}%# %#nTasksHeight%#
*Script ~bang